1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,794
The guide ends by describing the boy's eyes in the tourist's own language: eyes surrounded by mountains, eyes that welcome, eyes in which hides the end of life.

2
00:00:10,794 --> 00:00:13,164
And then the final sentence: Look!

3
00:00:13,164 --> 00:00:19,153
They are just as beautiful as the setting sun's reflection in the eyes of the Buddha.

4
00:00:19,153 --> 00:00:23,033
Beauty and suffering, joined into one picture.

